## Fonts

The interface uses the **IBM Plex** family (Sans, Mono, Serif), licensed under
the **SIL Open Font License 1.1**. The fonts are loaded from a font CDN at
runtime and are not redistributed with this repository. If you self-host the
fonts instead, the OFL applies: keep the OFL text with the font files and do not
sell the font on its own. The OFL reserves the "IBM Plex" name.

## Data sources

FlowDesktop retrieves all market data from the **whereq.cloud Data API**, called
with your own API key. That service has its own terms, and **FlowDesktop does
not grant you any rights to it** — your key, your account, your obligations.
See [docs/data-sources.md](docs/data-sources.md) for what it provides.

FlowDesktop bundles no scraper and no market-data snapshot. The SEC filing
metadata the API returns is derived from public US government data (SEC EDGAR);
the short-interest and insider data are aggregated by the API's own
collectors.

If you redistribute a database built by the collector, you are responsible for
complying with the terms of the source the data came from.

